                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c99b61ca-3077-37d7-9d61-f63dd0df7d9d",
                        "entry_id": "40759c34-4929-3522-8351-dcb325f8b432",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. оледеневать, оледенеть; покрывание льдом со всех сторон, по всей поверхности; превращение в лёд"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd42437c-aeed-400b-8f13-939a8fb42d04",
                                "sense_id": "c99b61ca-3077-37d7-9d61-f63dd0df7d9d",
                                "text": "Самое раннее оледенение (Гуронское) было в нижнем протерозое 2.5-2.2 млрд."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74eda1b1-91fb-3a73-ba31-908229648c6f",
                        "entry_id": "40759c34-4929-3522-8351-dcb325f8b432",
                        "glosses": [
                            "результат такого действия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29d438ee-aed5-458a-a138-acff83f2d2f0",
                                "sense_id": "74eda1b1-91fb-3a73-ba31-908229648c6f",
                                "text": "Новые исследования показывают, что в последние годы наземное оледенение Арктики в целом уменьшается."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69395387-2e74-3260-a98f-1a0d68133de9",
                        "entry_id": "40759c34-4929-3522-8351-dcb325f8b432",
                        "glosses": [
                            "то же, что и обледенение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8e3076b-6968-42b4-8d9b-0eacdc2e4f49",
                                "sense_id": "69395387-2e74-3260-a98f-1a0d68133de9",
                                "text": "Чтобы уменьшить оледенение гермошлема, Евгений Андреев переворачивается на спину."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2096615f-fae8-49c2-a2da-15604bbd4c54",
                        "source_entry_id": "40759c34-4929-3522-8351-dcb325f8b432",
                        "target_lang_word": "freezing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "freezing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5e15dac-56fc-37e4-a139-0bb59816ad9c",
                                        "entry_id": "71158727-8ab5-3b66-8af4-9e952f02bdd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suffering or causing frost"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cc38907-03f1-3deb-a071-ed0d006865b8",
                                        "entry_id": "71158727-8ab5-3b66-8af4-9e952f02bdd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very cold"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "excessive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca2067ac-acfc-3049-a653-98c82741d819",
                                        "entry_id": "71158727-8ab5-3b66-8af4-9e952f02bdd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zero °C, the freezing point of water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "with above or below"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cad73f3-0d25-43ee-90d6-014bd2090c69",
                                                "sense_id": "ca2067ac-acfc-3049-a653-98c82741d819",
                                                "text": "Despite this, the average temperature at the surface [of Mars] is 50–60K below freezing, making it hard to imagine that any plants or animals could survive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "freezing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7d008ff-3559-3a7f-8ec4-e397d9adc088",
                                        "entry_id": "df4c7899-d556-3539-a78a-e869ebf1114e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The change in state of a substance from liquid to solid by cooling to a critically low temperature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb7eaf2c-a2ba-4f9e-941e-7fb6594269a5",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d008ff-3559-3a7f-8ec4-e397d9adc088",
                                                "text": "Hence, there is a succession of thawings and freezings. The former expand, and endeavour to restore the surface of the ground to its natural condition, while the latter contract and harden it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48bf2e5c-eb9e-4c4f-aa53-41d9d1aa2357",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d008ff-3559-3a7f-8ec4-e397d9adc088",
                                                "text": "[…] and the sloping collection of fractured rocks—known as talus—that tumbled down from the quartzite bluffs during the repeated freezings and unfreezings of the last Ice Age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83d3f626-b5c5-3ec1-882c-1f5c68a82153",
                                        "entry_id": "df4c7899-d556-3539-a78a-e869ebf1114e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The action of numbing with anesthetics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "freezing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abb80f9f-5b55-3898-b39f-1f85f905d9bb",
                                        "entry_id": "03ffd03a-ba7c-3bf9-b0da-0e7f3a64d4f2",
